      "message": "https://source.android.com/docs/core/architecture/aidl/aidl-annotations#javaonlystableparcelable\n\nJavaOnlyStableParcelable marks a parcelable declaration (not definition) as stable so that it can be referenced from other stable AIDL types.\n\nThe OffloadServiceInfo is also referred in the following place\n\n```\noneway interface IOffloadEngine {\n    void onOffloadServiceUpdated(in OffloadServiceInfo info);\n    void onOffloadServiceRemoved(in OffloadServiceInfo info);\n}\n```",
